. do 16_acreg_check.do 

. * 16_acreg_check.do : cross-check of 15_conley_se.py with acreg (Colella, Lal
> ive, Sakalli & Thoenig 2019)
. * Headline 2SLS, country + year FE, Bartlett kernels: spatial cutoff 2000 km,
>  serial cutoff all years (27) and 10.
. clear all

. ssc install hdfe, replace
